<title>ITALY: Gross yield 8.44 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 8.44 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 37.75 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     8.44	(8.42)    97.94	  (97.90)</p>
<p>    6-month     8.53	(8.52)    95.92	  (95.88)</p>
<p>    1-year	8.54	(8.52)    92.15	  (92.15)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on August 9.  </p>
<p>The Bank of Italy said that there were requests for 45.161 trillion lire of the 37.750 trillion lire worth of BOTs on offer, but only 37.560 trillion lire of paper was assigned.</p>
</text>
